00:00:00,297 --> 00:00:01,707
(Penny:)-Good night.
-Mm-hm.

2
00:00:08,638 --> 00:00:11,708
(Amy:)It was rather flattering
to have strangers send us drinks.

3
00:00:11,875 --> 00:00:14,045
(Bernadette:)Yeah, that felt nice.

4
00:00:16,046 --> 00:00:19,156
(Amy:)Maybe tomorrow morning
we put on some hot pants

5
00:00:19,316 --> 00:00:21,986
(Amy:)and see if we can score us
some free omelets.

6
00:00:24,888 --> 00:00:28,628
So, hypothetically, if we
were to have gone with them,

7
00:00:28,792 --> 00:00:29,962
(Bernadette:)which one would you have picked?

8
00:00:33,296 --> 00:00:35,836
(Amy:)I think I would have gone with the
short one with the goofy haircut.

9
00:00:35,999 --> 00:00:38,449
(Bernadette:)Oh, good, 'cause I liked
the tall thin one.

10
00:00:38,602 --> 00:00:40,642
(Bernadette:)He seemed intelligent,
kind of a loner,

11
00:00:40,804 --> 00:00:43,014
(Bernadette:)maybe a little sexually
inexperienced,

12
00:00:43,173 --> 00:00:45,743
(Bernadette:)like I'd have
to teach him a thing or two.

13
00:00:48,011 --> 00:00:51,621
(Amy:)Not my guy.
I caught him staring at my rack.

14
00:00:52,749 --> 00:00:53,749
(Amy:)It'd be nice to be with a man

15
00:00:53,917 --> 00:00:57,027
(Amy:)who wants to know
what's underneath my cardigan.

